            <h1>CP12 gas safety certificate software UK: options for gas engineers 2026.</h1>
            <p class="page-lede">Gas Safe engineers have more options than ever for producing CP12 records. from paper pads to dedicated certificate apps to WhatsApp-based workflows. This guide compares them honestly, for engineers and for firm directors running 3-15 engineers.</p>
        </div>
